@startuml UC6_Translate_Data
!theme plain
title C4 Level 4 — Code Diagram: UC6 Translate Data to/from PH Core HL7 FHIR R4 / HL7 v2

package "internal.handlers" {
    class IngestHandler <<struct>> {
        + aiService: AIService
        + mapper: Mapper
        + HandleIngest(w: ResponseWriter, r: Request)
    }
}

package "internal.services" {
    class AIService <<struct>> {
        - localLLMURL: String
        + GetTransformDirection(srcFmt: String, dstFmt: String): String
        + TransformWithAI(payload: String, direction: String): TransformResult
    }

    class Mapper <<struct>> {
        + FallbackTransform(payload: String, direction: String): map[string]interface{}
    }
    
    class TransformResult <<struct>> {
        + Success: bool
        + Data: String
        + Error: error
        + UsedModel: String
    }
}

class "Local LLM Server" as LocalLLMServer << (E, #FF7700) External System >> {
    + POST /api/generate(model: string, prompt: string)
}

IngestHandler --> AIService : calls
IngestHandler --> Mapper : calls (fallback)
AIService ..> TransformResult : produces
AIService --> LocalLLMServer : HTTP POST request

note top of IngestHandler
  <b>Pipeline orchestrator</b>
  1. Calls GetTransformDirection()
  2. Calls TransformWithAI()
  3. On AI failure: calls mapper.FallbackTransform()
  4. On fallback failure: sets QUARANTINED (HTTP 422)
end note

note bottom of AIService
  <b>GetTransformDirection</b>
  Maps source+destination formats to a direction constant.
  'HL7V2' + 'FHIR_R4' -> 'HL7V2_TO_FHIR_R4'
  
  <b>TransformWithAI</b>
  Builds a clinical data transformation prompt.
  Sends request to Local LLM (Llama 3 via Ollama/vLLM).
end note

note bottom of Mapper
  <b>FallbackTransform</b>
  Rule-based field-by-field mapping. No AI required.
  HL7V2->FHIR R4: maps PID fields to FHIR Patient Bundle entry.
  FHIR R4->HL7V2: maps Bundle.entry[0].resource to MSH/PID.
end note

@enduml
